  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "在问孩子将来做什么以前，先给探索留一点位置",
      "source_seconds": 379.8,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "职业消失时，为什么连自己也像消失了",
      "source_seconds": 510.06,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "寻找稳定之处，不等于找一个永远不变的本质",
      "source_seconds": 890.25,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "敬畏不总是愉快，也不只是惊叹",
      "source_seconds": 1181.1,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "从看见伟大，到看见自己可以参与",
      "source_seconds": 1582.02,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "一位母亲没有得到的自由，变成孩子的尝试空间",
      "source_seconds": 1838.46,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "先尝到乐趣，与以后补上基本功",
      "source_seconds": 2054.97,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "机会不是只靠等待，也不是只靠勇敢",
      "source_seconds": 2336.16,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "身边的人越来越强，快乐却可能越来越少",
      "source_seconds": 2767.26,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "失去之后，不必马上证明这一切都有好处",
      "source_seconds": 3345.09,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "新的热爱，不必复制旧的那一种感觉",
      "source_seconds": 4145.67,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "不确定令人紧张，不等于一定想要坏结果",
      "source_seconds": 4522.98,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "想象未来时，别忘了未来的自己也会变化",
      "source_seconds": 4714.98,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "自我认识，也受自己碰巧经历过什么限制",
      "source_seconds": 4882.95,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "真实做自己，也要包括自己怎样影响别人",
      "source_seconds": 5226.72,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "需要的不一定是更多安慰，也可能是换一个角度",
      "source_seconds": 5646.48,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "同一目标，接近它与躲开失败会有不同感受",
      "source_seconds": 6111.69,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "一封邮件与一些选择，怎样让目标更像自己的",
      "source_seconds": 6293.28,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "同路人能展示失败，回音室却会缩小视野",
      "source_seconds": 6785.16,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "改变别人的想法，先理解他为什么需要那个想法",
      "source_seconds": 7088.16,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "共情不只有一起难受这一种形式",
      "source_seconds": 7765.23,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "制定计划时，让未来那个疲惫的自己有发言权",
      "source_seconds": 8110.83,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "给失误预留位置，再把重新开始缩小一点",
      "source_seconds": 8211.54,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "中间阶段的热情，往往需要另外照顾",
      "source_seconds": 8423.28,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "把即时乐趣放进难做的事情里",
      "source_seconds": 8553.51,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    },
    {
      "title": "一次经历怎样结束，会影响下次愿不愿回来",
      "source_seconds": 8753.13,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified_audio"
    }
  ],
  "updated": "2026-10-31T13:41:24Z"
}
